{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Play random sports mixed together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sportsday - each game is a randomly generated by mixing together different kinds of sports. Have you ever tried bowling with a baseball bat? Or football with a golf club? Who knows what weird sports you'll end up playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/extras/0cc73de3ae2916f2bd5e8ab220386955.poster.avif?t=1754497370\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/extras/0cc73de3ae2916f2bd5e8ab220386955.webm?t=1754497370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/extras/0cc73de3ae2916f2bd5e8ab220386955.mp4?t=1754497370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against your friends in a tournament or casual games. Gather as many points as possible and see who will end up being the champion! Make sure to pick up power-ups and bonus points along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/extras/5a282b089096663b9c99e16537fc8a42.poster.avif?t=1754497370\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/extras/5a282b089096663b9c99e16537fc8a42.webm?t=1754497370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502930/extras/5a282b089096663b9c99e16537fc8a42.mp4?t=1754497370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >